      "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a1fe60-6a4b-74b4-947e-e540fb18aecd -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 The quickstart worker leaves the scheduled report pending\n\nThis change makes `schedule` enqueue on `report-dispatch`, but [`README.md`](https://github.com/hasansyed-proofline/bench-proofline/blob/fcb0c2a94196532d3d49af8d99d731474b00c1c2/README.md?plain=1#L5-L8) still tells readers to run the worker with `--queue reports`.\n\nOn a fresh database, the quickstart worker delivers zero jobs and the report remains pending.\n\nUpdate the quickstart worker command to use `--queue report-dispatch`.\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a1fe4f-49f1-7732-81cb-f1d6ad806605/reviews/01a1fe5f-dfb6-7224-b4d0-ce38de8a5762/findings/01a1fe60-6a4f-7433-98a5-37dbe5d7205c)",
